    "show_share": true,
    "description": "As we celebrate International Nurses Day today, I would like to appreciate nurses all across the world for their endless commitment to taking care of everyone, even during these uncertain times. At SONAM East Africa, as we continue to interact with our students remotely, we remember that nurses are also responding to other non-COVID related illnesses by providing care for patients with pre-existing conditions and those requiring emergency care and routine services. As nurses, we see life and death, courage and hopelessness, fear and bravery, tragedy and best of all, success.",
